msgid ""
"The company %(company)s is registered under a special DGI taxpayer regime "
"(Literal E), so CFE lines can not include VAT taxes with a rate other than "
"0%% (exempt). Please fix the taxes on the invoice lines before sending "
"(%(taxes)s)"
msgstr ""
